flowchart TB
    D["Draft<br/>viewer's own data permissions"] --> P["Publish<br/>choose data permissions"]
    P --> S["Shared data permissions<br/>publisher's credentials, shared cache"]
    P --> I["Individual data permissions<br/>viewer's credentials, per user cache"]
    S --> SH["Share<br/>CAN VIEW, CAN RUN, CAN EDIT, CAN MANAGE"]
    I --> SH
    SH --> V["A viewer opens it<br/>dashboard cache, then query result cache,<br/>then the SQL warehouse"]
    SH --> SC["A schedule runs<br/>refreshes the dashboard cache"]
    SC --> SU["Subscribers receive a snapshot<br/>PDF by email"]
